  "description": "Inject a burst of nostalgic energy into your designs with Sakib, a premium retro bubble font that celebrates the vibrant aesthetics of the 70s and 80s. Featuring thick, pillowy curves and a friendly, high-impact silhouette, this font is perfect for statement t-shirts, playful logos, and eye-catching event posters. Sakib is designed to pop against colorful backgrounds, offering a hi-res and vibrant look that brings a sense of fun to both personal and commercial projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Inject a burst of nostalgic energy into your designs with Sakib, a premium retro bubble font that celebrates the vibrant aesthetics of the 70s and 80s. Featuring thick, pillowy curves and a friendly, high-impact silhouette, this font is perfect for statement t-shirts, playful logos, and eye-catching event posters. Sakib is designed to pop against colorful backgrounds, offering a hi-res and vibrant look that brings a sense of fun to both personal and commercial projects.</p>",
